<div class="admin">
  <p><a href={~p"/admin"}>&larr; Games</a></p>
  <h1>Insights</h1>
  <p class="admin-muted">
    Last {@report.days} days
    (<a href={~p"/admin/insights?days=1"}>1</a>
    · <a href={~p"/admin/insights?days=7"}>7</a>
    · <a href={~p"/admin/insights?days=14"}>14</a>
    · <a href={~p"/admin/insights?days=30"}>30</a>
    · <a href={~p"/admin/insights?days=90"}>90</a>). Dates are UTC.
    Visitor tracking started {when_at(@report.tracking_since)}; sections built on
    it only cover visits since then. Game sections use every game log.
  </p>

  <h2>Where visitors drop off</h2>
  <p class="admin-muted">
    Unique visitors (anonymous browser cookie) reaching each step. Only browsers that
    ran the page count, so crawlers are left out.
  </p>
  <table class="admin-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Step</th><th>Visitors</th><th>% of all</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr :for={step <- @report.funnel}>
        <td>{step.label}</td>
        <td>{step.count}</td>
        <td>{pct(step.pct)}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Leaving games</h2>
  <p class="admin-muted">
    {@report.exit_points.left} of {@report.exit_points.total_games} human seats were
    given up before the game ended (a bot played for them and they never came back).
    "Waiting on" is the move the game needed from them when they went.
  </p>
  <table class="admin-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Hand</th><th>Had made a move?</th><th>Waiting on</th><th>Players</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr :for={row <- @report.exit_points.rows}>
        <td>{row.hand}</td>
        <td>{if row.never_moved, do: "no", else: "yes"}</td>
        <td>{row.waiting_on}</td>
        <td>{row.count}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>Players who left in the first hand</h3>
  <p class="admin-muted">Watch these replays to see what stopped them.</p>
  <table class="admin-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>When</th><th>Device</th><th>Their moves</th><th>Left after</th><th>Waiting on</th><th>
          Game
        </th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr :for={s <- @report.early_exits}>
        <td>{when_at(s.at)}</td>
        <td>{s.device}</td>
        <td>{s.moves}</td>
        <td>{seconds(s.left_at_ms)}</td>
        <td>{s.left_before}</td>
        <td><a href={~p"/admin/games/#{s.game_id}"}>log &amp; replays</a></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Phones vs computers</h2>
  <table class="admin-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Device</th><th>Games</th><th>Left in hand 1</th><th>Played to the end</th><th>
          Median time per card
        </th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr :for={d <- @report.devices}>
        <td>{d.device}</td>
        <td>{d.games}</td>
        <td>{pct(d.left_first_hand)}</td>
        <td>{pct(d.stayed)}</td>
        <td>{seconds(d.median_play_ms)}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <table class="admin-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Screen width</th><th>Visitors</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr :for={v <- @report.viewports}>
        <td>{v.bucket}</td>
        <td>{v.visitors}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>How long decisions take</h2>
  <p class="admin-muted">
    From the moment it became the player's turn to their move. Approximate: includes
    animations the log doesn't record. Slow first-hand moves that speed up later suggest
    the rules or the controls take some learning.
  </p>
  <table class="admin-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Move</th><th>Hand</th><th>Device</th><th>Moves</th><th>Median</th><th>Slowest 10%</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr :for={d <- @report.decision_times}>
        <td>{d.action}</td>
        <td>{d.hand}</td>
        <td>{d.device}</td>
        <td>{d.n}</td>
        <td>{seconds(d.median_ms)}</td>
        <td>{seconds(d.p90_ms)}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Bot difficulty</h2>
  <p class="admin-muted">
    Games a single human played to the end against bots: {@report.bots.games}.
    The human's team won {pct(@report.bots.won)}.
  </p>
  <table class="admin-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Week of</th><th>Games</th><th>Human team won</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr :for={w <- @report.bots.by_week}>
        <td>{w.week}</td>
        <td>{w.games}</td>
        <td>{pct(w.won)}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Visitors by day</h2>
  <table class="admin-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Date</th><th>Visitors</th><th>New</th><th>Returning</th><th>Games opened</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr :for={d <- @report.visitors_by_day}>
        <td>{d.date}</td>
        <td>{d.visitors}</td>
        <td>{d.new}</td>
        <td>{d.returning}</td>
        <td>{d.games_opened}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Where visitors come from</h2>
  <table class="admin-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Referrer</th><th>Visitors</th><th>Opened a game</th><th>%</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr :for={r <- @report.referrers}>
        <td>{r.source}</td>
        <td>{r.visitors}</td>
        <td>{r.played}</td>
        <td>{pct(r.pct)}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Does the Learn page help?</h2>
  <table class="admin-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th></th><th>Games</th><th>Left in hand 1</th><th>Played to the end</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr :for={l <- @report.learn}>
        <td>{l.label}</td>
        <td>{l.games}</td>
        <td>{pct(l.left_first_hand)}</td>
        <td>{pct(l.stayed)}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Queue and multiplayer</h2>
  <table class="admin-table">
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Joined the public queue</td><td>{@report.queue.public_joins}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>... when nobody else was waiting</td><td>{@report.queue.joined_empty_queue}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Left the queue without a game</td><td>{@report.queue.left_queue}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Median wait before leaving</td>
        <td>{seconds(@report.queue.median_wait_before_leaving_ms)}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Bots added</td><td>{@report.queue.bots_added}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Private games created</td><td>{@report.queue.private_created}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Games with 2+ humans</td>
        <td>{@report.queue.games_with_2_plus_humans} of {@report.queue.games}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
